				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Set up your Mac host, SSH port, username and password when importing this shortcut.

Enable Remote Login on your Mac and sign in to the desktop. Move Sidecar Assistant to Applications, then save either automatic device discovery or your preferred iPad in its settings.

Run this shortcut to connect to your saved iPad, even if auto-connect is disabled or a physical display is present. BetterDisplay is still needed when no usable display is available.

Automatic device selection searches once. If your iPad is not found, wake and unlock it and try again. You do not need to enter the iPad name here.</string>
			</dict>
